# welcome-fit-menu-pick-light-1024x640 (fix-fit-menu): the gear clicked at
# its zoomed centre (987, 31) in a 1024 x 640 window, then the light/dark
# control's "Light" cell at its drawn centre (941, 106) - the cell the
# popover's `zoom: calc(1 / var(--fit))` leaves at natural size under the
# gear. The shot: the page in Always light (Clean Teal). The behaviour: the
# theme line reads clean-teal, as the reference's reads.
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 987 31
wait 500
click 941 106
wait 500
shot welcome-fit-menu-pick-light-1024x640
